  "description": "Launcher for the MCP server built into Rillsoft Project 10 (Windows). Forwards stdio to the local endpoint http://127.0.0.1:3928/mcp; without Rillsoft Project running it lists the 118 tools from tools-list.json. Requires Rillsoft Project 10 running on this Windows machine for real results.",
